---
/**
 * Fine line-art ingredient motifs — one inline sprite, referenced by
 * <svg><use href="#m-name"/></svg>. Single-weight strokes (set by the user
 * element), 48×48 grid, round joins for a slightly hand-drawn feel.
 * Keep the ids in sync with ./names.ts.
 */
